<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Ferramentas do servidor teteo: código, dados, backups e automação em um só lugar.">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <title>teteo · Ferramentas</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='8' fill='%23151e32'/%3E%3Cpath d='M8 9h16v4h-6v12h-4V13H8z' fill='%236de5d0'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
  <style>
    :root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0c1220;--surface:#141e30;--line:#293650;--text:#f1f5fc;--muted:#b0bdd2;--accent:#6de5d0}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html{font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;line-height:1.5;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}body{margin:0;font-size:1rem}a{color:inherit}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:5px}.skip{position:absolute;top:-100px;padding:.7rem;background:var(--surface)}.skip:focus{top:10px;left:10px;z-index:2}.wrap{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:0 28px}header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;min-height:92px;gap:20px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px}.mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg);font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:850}.brand strong{font-size:1.4rem;letter-spacing:-.04em}.brand span:last-child{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:16px;margin-left:8px}.network{color:var(--muted);font-size:.875rem;background:#192439;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px}main{padding-top:36px;padding-bottom:48px}.intro{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:20px;margin-bottom:32px}h1{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.4rem);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 10px}.intro p{color:var(--muted);margin:0;max-width:620px}.count{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}.sections{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px}.group{min-width:0}.group h2{font-size:.875rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}.group h2:before{content:"";height:3px;width:22px;background:var(--tone);border-radius:2px}.cards{display:grid;gap:14px}.card{display:block;min-height:192px;padding:23px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:14px;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .15s,transform .15s,background .15s}.card:hover{border-color:var(--tone);background:#19263b;transform:translateY(-2px)}.card-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}.icon{width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--tone);background:#0d1626;border-radius:9px}.icon svg{height:22px;width:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.kind{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:2px 7px}.card h3{font-size:1.18rem;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 7px;letter-spacing:-.015em}.card p{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 17px;line-height:1.5}.host{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--tone);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.note{margin-top:28px;display:flex;align-items:start;gap:12px;padding:17px 20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}.note strong{color:var(--text);font-weight:600}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:21px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.875rem}.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}footer a{text-underline-offset:4px}svg.defs{display:none}@media(min-width:900px){.group:first-child .card{min-height:220px}}@media(max-width:850px){.sections{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.group:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}.group:last-child .cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.card{padding:19px}.brand span:last-child{display:none}}@media(max-width:640px){.wrap{padding:0 20px}.top{min-height:78px}.intro{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.sections{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.group:last-child{grid-column:auto}.group:last-child .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card{min-height:0}.note{display:block}.note strong{display:block;margin-bottom:5px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.card{transition:none}.card:hover{transform:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#ferramentas">Ir para as ferramentas</a>
<svg class="defs" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><defs>
<symbol id="git" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="6" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><path d="M6 8v8m12-8a7 7 0 0 1-7 7H6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="data" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v14c0 4 16 4 16 0V5M4 12c0 4 16 4 16 0"/></symbol>
<symbol id="box" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m12 2 9 5v10l-9 5-9-5V7l9-5zm0 10v10M3 7l9 5 9-5M7 4l9 5"/></symbol>
<symbol id="api" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m8 5-6 7 6 7m8-14 6 7-6 7m-3-16-2 18"/></symbol>
<symbol id="backup" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 10a9 9 0 1 1 2 9M3 3v7h7m2-3v6l4 2"/></symbol>
<symbol id="check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m4 12 5 5L20 6M4 4h7M4 21h16"/></symbol>
<symbol id="watch" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 12s4-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-4 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></symbol>
<symbol id="jobs" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="15" y="15" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M9 6h9v9M6 9v9h9"/></symbol>
<symbol id="buttons" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4V8z"/></symbol>
</defs></svg>
<header><div class="wrap top"><div class="brand"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">t</span><strong>teteo</strong><span>Seu servidor, em um lugar.</span></div><span class="network">Rede local</span></div></header>
<main class="wrap" id="ferramentas">
  <div class="intro"><div><h1>O que você precisa fazer?</h1><p>Escolha a ferramenta pelo trabalho que quer realizar.</p></div><span class="count">8 painéis · 1 endpoint S3</span></div>
  <div class="sections">
    <section class="group" style="--tone:#6de5d0" aria-labelledby="codigo"><h2 id="codigo">Criar & desenvolver</h2><div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="https://git.{{ teteo_domain }}/"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#git"/></svg></span><span class="kind">Código</span></div><h3>Forgejo</h3><p>Repositórios privados, pull requests, CI e publicação de pacotes.</p><span class="host">git.{{ teteo_domain }}</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="https://pb.{{ teteo_domain }}/_/"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#data"/></svg></span><span class="kind">Apps</span></div><h3>PocketBase</h3><p>Crie coleções, gerencie usuários e arquivos para seus aplicativos.</p><span class="host">pb.{{ teteo_domain }}</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="https://minio.{{ teteo_domain }}/"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#box"/></svg></span><span class="kind">Arquivos</span></div><h3>MinIO</h3><p>Consulte buckets e objetos no armazenamento S3 do servidor.</p><span class="host">minio.{{ teteo_domain }}</span></a>
    </div></section>
    <section class="group" style="--tone:#f4c477" aria-labelledby="cuidar"><h2 id="cuidar">Cuidar & acompanhar</h2><div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="https://backup.{{ teteo_domain }}/"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#backup"/></svg></span><span class="kind">Backups</span></div><h3>Backrest</h3><p>Explore os backups, consulte snapshots e restaure arquivos.</p><span class="host">backup.{{ teteo_domain }}</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="https://checks.{{ teteo_domain }}/"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#check"/></svg></span><span class="kind">Manutenção</span></div><h3>Healthchecks</h3><p>Confira se backup, restore de teste e limpeza foram executados.</p><span class="host">checks.{{ teteo_domain }}</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="https://watch.{{ teteo_domain }}/"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#watch"/></svg></span><span class="kind">Monitoramento</span></div><h3>changedetection.io</h3><p>Acompanhe mudanças em páginas e conteúdos da web.</p><span class="host">watch.{{ teteo_domain }}</span></a>
    </div></section>
    <section class="group" style="--tone:#b7a6ff" aria-labelledby="automatizar"><h2 id="automatizar">Executar & conectar</h2><div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="https://jobs.{{ teteo_domain }}/"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#jobs"/></svg></span><span class="kind">Workflows</span></div><h3>Dagu</h3><p>Consulte agendamentos, execuções e logs das rotinas do servidor.</p><span class="host">jobs.{{ teteo_domain }}</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="https://buttons.{{ teteo_domain }}/"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#buttons"/></svg></span><span class="kind">Ações rápidas</span></div><h3>OliveTin</h3><p>Dispare um backup ou um teste de restauração com um botão.</p><span class="host">buttons.{{ teteo_domain }}</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="https://s3.{{ teteo_domain }}/"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#api"/></svg></span><span class="kind">API</span></div><h3>Endpoint S3</h3><p>Endereço para conectar aplicações e clientes S3. Acesso por API.</p><span class="host">s3.{{ teteo_domain }}</span></a>
    </div></section>
  </div>
  <aside class="note"><strong>Primeiro acesso?</strong><span>Os painéis usam nomes da rede local e HTTPS. Configure a resolução de <strong>{{ teteo_domain }}</strong> e confie no certificado do servidor no seu dispositivo. Os acessos protegidos continuam exigindo autenticação.</span></aside>
</main>
<footer><div class="wrap foot"><span>teteo · Ferramentas da casa</span><a href="https://{{ teteo_domain }}/">{{ teteo_domain }}</a></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
